 "description": "Kronik2008 - Improving alloreactive CTL immunotherapy for malignant gliomas using a simulation model of their interactive dynamics\nBioModels BIOMD0000000808 (curated). SBML file: Kronik2008.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 17280 time units (SED-ML: Kronik2008.sedml), sampling 17.142857142857142.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 8.95e-03 of species peak (worst: C)\nIndependent check of this deck (SciPy integration with Kintecus semantics) against the SBML: max |difference| = 5.74e-09 of species peak.\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Tumor_Elimination_CTL term 1/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [info] Tumor_Elimination_CTL term 2/2: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed\n  [partial] CTL_Infusion term 1/5: Kintecus V2027 mis-reads this long USER expression (FATAL #999 or a wrong value) in every equivalent form tried\n  [partial] CTL_Infusion term 2/5: Kintecus V2027 mis-reads this long USER expression (FATAL #999 or a wrong value) in every equivalent form tried\n  [partial] CTL_Infusion term 3/5: Kintecus V2027 mis-reads this long USER expression (FATAL #999 or a wrong value) in every equivalent form tried\n  [partial] CTL_Infusion term 4/5: Kintecus V2027 mis-reads this long USER expression (FATAL #999 or a wrong value) in every equivalent form tried\n  [partial] CTL_Infusion term 5/5: Kintecus V2027 mis-reads this long USER expression (FATAL #999 or a wrong value) in every equivalent form tried\nRenamed species (Kintecus name = SBML id): T1 = T",
